      "note": "False positive. `role` here is a domain label enum (Maker::FileAttachment::ROLES = model/instructions/image/source_archive/gcode/other), NOT a security/authorization role. It is validated by `inclusion: { in: ROLES }` on the model, so an attacker cannot inject an arbitrary value. The attachment is always scoped to current_user via the parent association, so mass-assigning it grants no privilege escalation."
